# Base URL of the Express server (server/), no trailing slash.
#
# Leave unset for local development - the client then uses
# http://localhost:3000, which is where the server runs by default.
#
# For a deployment (e.g. Vercel) set this to the public URL of the hosted
# server, and allow the client's origin on the server side with
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS in server/.env. Vite only exposes variables prefixed
# VITE_ to the browser bundle.
VITE_API_BASE=
